  "expected_findings": [
    "SEG-EFF-01: multiple policy engines affect the same flow",
    "SEG-EFF-02: runtime source and destination identities are missing",
    "SEG-EFF-03: selector resolution is missing",
    "SEG-EFF-04: Calico Pass and lower-tier allow can change the effective decision",
    "SEG-EFF-05: Cilium deny/allow overlap lacks endpoint decision evidence",
    "SEG-EFF-06: enforcement mode is unknown or staged for relevant engines",
